{"id":"1a9169e14b5684de","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-axiom-l.md","title":"GL Axiom L (Löb Axiom)","display":"df-gl-axiom-l — GL Axiom L (Löb Axiom)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-axiom-l","aliases":["89-df-gl-axiom-l"],"display":"df-gl-axiom-l — GL Axiom L (Löb Axiom)","depends_on":["[[89-df-lob-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-axiom-l"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-axiom-l</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-axiom-l — GL Axiom L (Löb Axiom)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}l}\\vdash\nL^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}l}\\vdash\nL^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^{\\star}\">\\(L^{\\star}\\)</span> : 本章对 Löb 公理模式的别名</li>\n<li>Löb 模式的完整形状是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\Box\\varphi\">\\(\\Box(\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\Box\\varphi\\)</span>；不能省略外层结论。</li>\n<li>Löb公理对应Löb定理的模态版本</li>\n<li>标准公理化是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm K+L\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm K+L\\)</span>；由于模式 4 可由其导出，\n也可等价写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}+L\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}+L\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-lob-axiom]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}l}\\vdash\nL^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{L}.","display":true},{"tex":"L^{\\star}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\Box\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm K+L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}+L","display":false}],"bytes":824,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-axiom-l]]"}],"outgoing":["491579297d817026"]}